      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Hey all,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Happy to be here!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hopefully this is the right place to post this question: is there a comprehensive list of every Sentinels of the Multiverse crossover? I mean crossover in the sense that a character from Sentinels of the Multiverse has crossed over into another game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHere's what I've gathered so far:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBottom of the 9th - Almost the whole cast of SOTM<br />\r\nLazer Ryderz - Visionary, Captain Cosmic, and maybe one other?<br />\r\nDresden Files Card Game - Ra<br />\r\nPixel Lincoln - The Freedom Five<br />\r\nOne Deck Dungoen - Fanatic<br />\r\nAeon's End - Nightmist<br />\r\nArkham Horror - (Not a crossover in the truest sense but the Joe Diamond / Faye Diamond connection is worth mentioning)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAm I missing any?</p>",
