      "created_at": "2019-03-18T18:56:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wasn't there some sort of crossover between SotM and Galactic Strikeforce? It's the same universe, I know, but I'm not sure what, if any, particular element of SotM actually shows up in GSF.</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
