      "created_at": "2019-05-27T06:34:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay so here's a revised list:<br>\n<br>\nAeon's End - Nightmist<br>\nArkham Horror - Joe Diamond<br>\nBattlecon - Legacy plus Freedom Five<br>\nBetrayal at the House on the Hill - Biomancer Clone<br>\nBottom of the 9th - Almost the whole cast of SOTM<br>\nDresden Files Card Game - Ra<br>\nGalactic Strikeforce - Vognild Prime<br>\nLazer Ryderz - Visionary, Captain Cosmic, and maybe one other?<br>\nOne Deck Dungeon - Fanatic<br>\nPixel Lincoln - The Freedom Five<br>\nSpirit Island - Nexus of the Void<br>\n<br>\nThat being said are there any more that people have been able to find?</p>",
